# --curl pin (WI-0013 sem-S6 + subagent-review F1): 3-prior-knowledge
# emits --http3-only under --curl even though the http3 feature-gate
# defer would fire on a real send — upstream's to_curl short-circuit
# runs before client build, so the emit is reachable and must not error.
argv: --curl --http-version 3-prior-knowledge GET https://example.org/
